  "pitch": "A customs house burns, and by morning half the town owes money to a man who drowned eighty years ago.",
  "about": [
   "Harrow Quay lives on salt. Every barrel is weighed, taxed and written down, and the book it is written in has just gone up in smoke along with the house that held it. Three tide-clerks are missing. Nobody saw anything. Everybody is suddenly very interested in buying you a drink.",
   "The Salt Ledger is an introduction for new heroes: a town to learn, a coast to explore, and a question that gets heavier each time you answer it. Who is owed, and for what?"
  ],
  "patron": [
